    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">What is it?</div>
    <p>A coalition of Alumni, Students, Faculty, and Friends who have joined together to provide on-going private support to preserve the Department's dedication and commitment to excellence.</p>

    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Why the Need?</div>
    <p>"Shrinking" state budget for higher education makes this support crucial to continue to offer the highest quality education and training to our students. Private funding is now critical to safeguard course offerings, laboratory supplies, computer labs, equipment, and scholarships. SJSU can no longer be considered as state supported but state assisted.</p>

